<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45771" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφιζάνω</span></b> , Acol. impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσδανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					28.7
				</span></i>
			:—<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>, always in impf., <i>sit at</i> or <i>in</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείπνῳ, αἰθούσῃσιν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				10.578
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				20.11
			</span></i>; <i>sit upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνος ἐπὶ βλεφάροισιν ἐφίζανεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νώτοισιν ἐφίζανε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.108
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῶκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.667
				</span></i>
			: later also in prcs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείλεσι ἀφρὸς ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					2.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τις ὥρα καὶ ῥυτίδι πρώτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, abs . . <i>form a deposit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.75
			</span></i>.</div>
